  "description": "\"Even if you have eyes, you must not see; even if you have ears, you must not hear; and even if you have a mouth, you must not speak.\" On the night Jinhong was to be bedded to conceive an heir, her father-in-law gave her this strict command. Through the pitch-black darkness, a man entered the room where she lay waiting. Jinhong knew nothing of his identity or where he had come from. With every relentless thrust, her body shook as her senses were overwhelmed by the heat of the stranger. She had been told she must receive the seeds of ten different men, yet the man from the previous night returned with a startling offer: \"I can help you escape.\" She expected a different man tonight, but it was the same man as before.\n\n[Original Webtoon](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=13793456)",
